  "details": "This is a proposal.\n\nI would like to suggest the creation of an OSC channel that allows VRChat to directly communicate with OpenAI in the future. This would enable us to safely build NPCs powered by ChatGPT inside worlds. NPCs utilizing AI hold great potential.\n\nI envision a future where VRChat and OpenAI can grow and evolve together. Therefore, I recommend that an OSC server be hosted on OpenAI’s side, and that VRChat add an SDK feature to allow direct connections to that server.",
